                                "text": "Bases dissolve skin oils and have a soapy feel to them."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be44b906-ac97-373b-ae10-ded39f2b28fd",
                        "entry_id": "960b81b6-1711-36b5-b7e5-6076aba51d47",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Literal senses:",
                            "Full of soap."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "877c1cb5-7ffb-4864-87cb-7964d0e1b512",
                                "sense_id": "be44b906-ac97-373b-ae10-ded39f2b28fd",
                                "text": "Near-synonym: soaped up"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ec04fcd-316f-4674-a73a-3ec132365095",
                                "sense_id": "be44b906-ac97-373b-ae10-ded39f2b28fd",
                                "text": "The dishwasher uses hot soapy water to clean the dishes and silverware."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8d5b361d-9255-3c86-b92a-73f4ced6837e",
                        "entry_id": "960b81b6-1711-36b5-b7e5-6076aba51d47",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Literal senses:",
                            "Covered in soap."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2da872d3-4c31-4f7d-b197-2dead4296166",
                                "sense_id": "8d5b361d-9255-3c86-b92a-73f4ced6837e",
                                "text": "His skin was still soapy after the shower."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d1ad050e-282f-3545-aeb1-34991918fce0",
                        "entry_id": "960b81b6-1711-36b5-b7e5-6076aba51d47",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Resembling a soap opera."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5602c351-0c97-4771-91e2-b6c59774eeaf",
                                "sense_id": "d1ad050e-282f-3545-aeb1-34991918fce0",
                                "text": "The heightened worlds of darkly comedic satire and soapy high-school romance make it easy enough to roll with unrealistic casting choices—and that goes for stage musicals, too, where some level of artifice is built into the format."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57540d5a-7ddb-461e-8f94-e79741253559",
                                "sense_id": "d1ad050e-282f-3545-aeb1-34991918fce0",
                                "text": "This Diana-obsessed series is the very definition of bad writing. Despite the brilliant cast, it’s a crass, soapy dive into the abyss – not least in the atrocious scenes featuring Ghost Diana[.]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
